; `open` listed in a flat `:symbols` import — route 2 of 4 of
; `reserved_open_direct.ein`'s declaration.
;
; A list of names takes `open`, a word a position gives a meaning to, so
; the listing reads the module, which is refused at its own line, as on the
; other routes: the same declaration, refused whichever way it comes.
(import reserved_open_direct :symbols (open))
